  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -226,
      "w": 800,
      "text": "Direction A — Reference. This canvas is now the build spec.\nMono for structure and metadata, Newsreader for anything you actually read.\n\nNumbers rule: outcome only. Users served, transaction volume, latency, downtime, time-to-resolution. No commits, lines, pull requests, files or decision-record counts anywhere.\n\nBuilding on Astro, deploying to Cloudflare Pages.\nResume button sits in the nav on every page and beside both calls to action. [PHOTO] is the last placeholder.\nOpen source and the phone view open dark so you can see both grounds at once."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-2",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -156,
      "w": 700,
      "text": "Two alternates, deliberately low-fi — they exist to settle the direction, not to be finished.\n\nB trades readability for personality and would date fastest.\nC is the strongest first impression but has nowhere to put a real body of work."
    }
